# LRU does not always win. The design plan's A B A C B on 2 lines, grown to fit the default
# 4-way cache: A B C D A E B C D. Every block lands in set 0.
#
# Run with the defaults (--cache 64 --block 4 --ways 4).
# Result: FIFO 4 hits, LRU 1 hit.
R 0x0000   # A
R 0x0010   # B
R 0x0020   # C
R 0x0030   # D
R 0x0000   # A: a hit for both, and LRU refreshes it
R 0x0040   # E: FIFO evicts A, LRU evicts B
R 0x0010   # B: FIFO hits; LRU misses and evicts C
R 0x0020   # C: FIFO hits; LRU misses and evicts D
R 0x0030   # D: FIFO hits; LRU misses and evicts A
